  "description": "<p>This task is to align the logging functionality with the documentation:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Configuring+Logging+With+System+Properties\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Configuring+Logging+With+System+Properties</a></p>\n\n<p>This ticket is complete when:<br/>\n1. The default logging level is INFO<br/>\n2. All logging can be changed by providing a value for the system property: -Dorg.fcrepo<br/>\n3. Specific package loggers can be changed independently of 1 or 2 above.</p>\n\n<p>Starting Fedora with the following logging settings should work as expected:<br/>\n&gt; mvn jetty:run -pl fcrepo-webapp/</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>log all packages at INFO</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>&gt; mvn -Dfcrepo.log=DEBUG jetty:run -pl fcrepo-webapp/</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>log all packages at DEBUG</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>&gt; mvn -Dfcrepo.log=DEBUG -Dfcrepo.log.jms=INFO jetty:run -pl fcrepo-webapp/</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>log all packages at DEBUG, except fcrepo.jms at INFO</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>&gt; mvn -Dfcrepo.log=DEBUG -Dfcrepo.log.jms=INFO -Dfcrepo.log.kernel=INFO jetty:run -pl fcrepo-webapp/</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>log all packages at DEBUG, except fcrepo.jms and fcrepo.kernel at INFO</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
